  "description": "Whether tricky root passages, flowing trails or crisp climbs, our ALLMTN 2 is your ticket to the world of unlimited all-mountain possibilities. A bike for which all paths are open to you. This is ensured not least by the mountain-savvy all-round equipment: thanks to 160mm travel at the fork and rear, plus a wheel mix of 29″ front and 27.5″ rear, you can roll over any obstacle in a relaxed manner on the downhills and still enjoy perfect traction on steep uphills. The compact and powerful Yamaha PW-X3 motor pushes you up even the steepest climbs in no time, while the 720Wh battery ensures that you can make the most of the electric tailwind even on long tours. In short: with this eMountainbike you will experience extreme off-road fun – regardless of how demanding the terrain is.",
